{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"八年春，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"夏六月，公子遂如齊，至黃乃復。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"辛巳，有事于大廟，仲遂卒于垂。壬午，猶繹，萬入，去籥。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"戊子，夫人贏氏薨。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"晉師、白狄伐秦。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"楚人滅舒蓼。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"秋七月甲子，日有食之，既。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"冬十月己丑，葬我小君敬贏，雨，不克葬。庚寅，日中而克葬。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"城平陽。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"楚師伐陳。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"八年春，白狄及晉平。夏，會晉伐秦。晉人獲秦諜，殺諸絳市，六日而蘇。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"有事于大廟，襄仲卒而繹，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"楚為眾舒叛，故伐舒蓼，滅之。楚子疆之，及滑汭。盟吳、越而還。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_16","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"晉胥克有蠱疾，郤缺為政。秋，廢胥克，使趙朔佐下軍。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_17","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"冬，葬敬贏，旱，無麻，始用葛茀。雨，不克葬，禮也。禮，卜葬，先遠日，辟不懷也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_18","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"城平陽，書，時也。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_ttr_122_19","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_122","textTraditional":"陳及晉平。楚師伐陳，取成而還。","sentenceOrder":19}],"overrides":{}}